{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","text":"MainActor"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"mergeChanges"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"into"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"store"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Swidux5StoreC","text":"Store","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/Store"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"State"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Action"},{"kind":"text","text":">, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"policy"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:17SwiduxPersistence11MergePolicyV","text":"MergePolicy","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/MergePolicy"},{"kind":"text","text":"? = nil) "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"}]}]},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The live store to reconcile."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"store"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Narrows the configured policy for this call only."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"policy"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This is what a remote-change observer should call. Where","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/PersistenceCoordinator\/rehydrate(into:policy:)","type":"reference"},{"text":" re-reads every row of every registered entity","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"on every tick, this reads the store’s transaction log since the last","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"merge and spends the result through ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/PersistenceCoordinator\/mergeRemote(into:ids:deleted:policy:)","type":"reference"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"— so a tick on an N-row table where k rows changed costs O(k). A tick with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"no transactions behind it costs one history fetch and nothing else.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Every guarantee the other two make holds here. Deletions come from history","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tombstones, which are positive evidence, so unlike a full re-hydration this","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"can"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" remove the last surviving row. Pending local writes and ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/PersistenceCoordinator\/editing","type":"reference"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"holds still win, and that is not configurable.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"When it re-reads everything instead","anchor":"When-it-re-reads-everything-instead","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The narrow path is an optimisation, never a weakening: anything that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"leaves a window unaccounted for falls back to the full read, and the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"fallback keeps its empty-snapshot guard. It happens on the first tick","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"after launch or a container rebuild, when the watermark has expired or the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"history fetch fails, when a deletion’s tombstone carries no identity","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(every row deleted before ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@Attribute(.preserveValueOnDeletion)"},{"text":" shipped),","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"when a changed row can’t be resolved, and when more than one store sits","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"behind the container.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The watermark advances whenever a tick read every registered entity","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"successfully — including a tick that declined to apply some of what it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"read. A row an editing hold defers is carried forward by identity and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"re-offered next tick, which is what keeps a hold from quietly becoming a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"veto without costing a full table read per tick to prevent. See","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"doc:HowToAddICloudSync","type":"text"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Both outcomes are reported: ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/PersistenceDiagnostic\/Kind-swift.struct\/remoteChangesMerged","type":"reference"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"for a narrowed tick, ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/PersistenceDiagnostic\/Kind-swift.struct\/historyUnavailable","type":"reference"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with a reason for a fallback. A narrowed tick counts what it re-offered","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"separately from what it merged, so a hold that is never released — which","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"makes every tick re-offer the same rows forever — reads as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/PersistenceDiagnostic\/carriedOverCount","type":"reference"},{"text":" equal to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/PersistenceDiagnostic\/mergedCount","type":"reference"},{"text":", rather than as healthy traffic.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence","doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/PersistenceCoordinator"]]},"sections":[],"metadata":{"extendedModule":"SwiduxPersistence","roleHeading":"Instance Method","role":"symbol","title":"mergeChanges(into:policy:)","modules":[{"name":"SwiduxPersistence"}],"externalID":"s:17SwiduxPersistence0B11CoordinatorCAA0A00A10ObservableRzrlE12mergeChanges4into6policyyAD5StoreCyxq_G_AA11MergePolicyVSgtYaF","symbolKind":"method","conformance":{"constraints":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"State"},{"text":" conforms to ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SwiduxObservable"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"availabilityPrefix":[{"text":"Available when","type":"text"}],"conformancePrefix":[{"text":"Conforms when","type":"text"}]},"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"mergeChanges"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"into"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Store","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Swidux5StoreC"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"State"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Action"},{"kind":"text","text":">, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"policy"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"MergePolicy","preciseIdentifier":"s:17SwiduxPersistence11MergePolicyV"},{"kind":"text","text":"?) "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"}]},"abstract":[{"text":"Merges only the rows persistent history says changed, falling back to a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"full ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/PersistenceCoordinator\/rehydrate(into:policy:)"},{"text":" whenever history can’t answer.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swiduxpersistence\/persistencecoordinator\/mergechanges(into:policy:)"]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/PersistenceCoordinator\/mergeChanges(into:policy:)"},"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://SwiduxPersistence/documentation/SwiduxPersistence":{"abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/swiduxpersistence","title":"SwiduxPersistence","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence","type":"topic","kind":"symbol"},"doc://Swidux/documentation/Swidux/Store":{"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swidux\/store","role":"symbol","title":"Store","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Store"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Generic store that owns the dispatch cycle, plugin lifecycle, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"observation layer."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Store"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/Store"},"doc://SwiduxPersistence/documentation/SwiduxPersistence/PersistenceCoordinator/editing":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"editing"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"EditingHolds","preciseIdentifier":"s:17SwiduxPersistence12EditingHoldsC"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Entities the app has declared it is editing, exempt from the merge